{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"heading","depth":1,"id":"roadmap","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Roadmap"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Seven milestones and two decision gates. Six are done and on npm; the seventh is\n1.0. Dates are deliberately absent: this is built by one person with AI\nassistance, and a date would be fiction."}]},{"type":"component","name":"roadmap","attributes":{},"children":[]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Until 1.0, releases come from the work below as it lands, each listed in the\n"},{"type":"link","href":"/changelog","children":[{"type":"text","value":"changelog"}]},{"type":"text","value":"."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"m0-foundations","children":[{"type":"text","value":"M0: Foundations"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Done."}]},{"type":"text","value":" The core every later milestone builds on:"}]},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"the workspace, the IR, longhand expansion and normalisation;"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"the precedence ladder and the layer plan;"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"the CSS writer and its golden fixtures;"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineComponent","name":"inline-code","tagName":"md-inline-code","attributes":{},"children":[],"properties":{"html":"<span class=\"th-token th-command\">kirana-style</span> build","source":"kirana-style build"}},{"type":"text","value":"."}]}]}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"m1-feasibility-slice","children":[{"type":"text","value":"M1: Feasibility slice"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Done."}]},{"type":"text","value":" Enough of Kirana to style a real application:"}]},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"the Vite adapter and cross-file resolution;"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineComponent","name":"inline-code","tagName":"md-inline-code","attributes":{},"children":[],"properties":{"html":"sx","source":"sx"}},{"type":"text","value":" for React, relations and "},{"type":"inlineComponent","name":"inline-code","tagName":"md-inline-code","attributes":{},"children":[],"properties":{"html":"select","source":"select"}},{"type":"text","value":";"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"keyframes, modes and themes, and the scales preset;"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"the first conformance runs against the StyleX and Tailwind originals."}]}]}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"m2-recipes-and-dynamic-styles","children":[{"type":"text","value":"M2: Recipes and dynamic styles"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Done."}]},{"type":"text","value":" Styles that depend on props and state:"}]},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineComponent","name":"inline-code","tagName":"md-inline-code","attributes":{},"children":[],"properties":{"html":"<span class=\"th-token th-function\">recipe</span>()","source":"recipe()"}},{"type":"text","value":" with slots, and finite and open dynamic values;"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"the private runtime, incremental rebuilds and hot updates;"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineComponent","name":"inline-code","tagName":"md-inline-code","attributes":{},"children":[],"properties":{"html":"<span class=\"th-token th-command\">kirana-style</span> migrate stylex","source":"kirana-style migrate stylex"}},{"type":"text","value":";"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"the full component set of our shadcn/ui port built on it, which is what\nfound most of the compiler's bugs."}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"One thing in this milestone's scope is deliberately not built: a persistent cache\non disk. The engine is 0.05 s of a 16 s build, so a cache that skips it saves\nnothing you could measure, and every key it has to get right is a way to serve\nstale CSS."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"m3-developer-experience","children":[{"type":"text","value":"M3: Developer experience"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Done, and published."}]},{"type":"text","value":" Editor and lint support, read from the compiler rather\nthan re-implemented, so they never disagree with the build."}]},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The language server"}]},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"link","href":"/docs/tooling/editor","children":[{"type":"inlineComponent","name":"inline-code","tagName":"md-inline-code","attributes":{},"children":[],"properties":{"html":"<span class=\"th-token th-command\">kirana-style</span> lsp","source":"kirana-style lsp"}}]},{"type":"text","value":":\ndiagnostics at the property, hover with the compiled CSS and the ladder step\nthat won, tokens in both modes, colour swatches, a summary after every "},{"type":"inlineComponent","name":"inline-code","tagName":"md-inline-code","attributes":{},"children":[],"properties":{"html":"sx","source":"sx"}},{"type":"text","value":",\ncompletion, navigation and quick fixes. Hover answers in 1.2 ms at the 95th\npercentile on our shadcn/ui port."}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Editors:"}]},{"type":"text","value":" the extension on the VS Code Marketplace and Open VSX, and the\nsame server in Vue, Svelte and Astro files; Zed through a dev extension, and\nNeovim and Helix through their own LSP configuration."}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Lint:"}]},{"type":"text","value":" "},{"type":"link","href":"/docs/tooling/lint","children":[{"type":"inlineComponent","name":"inline-code","tagName":"md-inline-code","attributes":{},"children":[],"properties":{"html":"@kirana-style/eslint-plugin","source":"@kirana-style/eslint-plugin"}}]},{"type":"text","value":" under Oxlint and\nESLint, and "},{"type":"link","href":"/docs/tooling/lint#biome","children":[{"type":"inlineComponent","name":"inline-code","tagName":"md-inline-code","attributes":{},"children":[],"properties":{"html":"@kirana-style/biome-plugin","source":"@kirana-style/biome-plugin"}}]},{"type":"text","value":" with the\nfour rules Biome can run."}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The command line:"}]},{"type":"text","value":" setting a project up and checking it, with a redacted\nbug report; compiling without a bundler; sizing the stylesheet; the design\nsystem as JSON; and reports for CI with GitHub annotations. The\n"},{"type":"link","href":"/docs/tooling/cli","children":[{"type":"text","value":"CLI page"}]},{"type":"text","value":" has every command."}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"CSS helpers checked at build time:"}]},{"type":"text","value":"\n"},{"type":"link","href":"/docs/styling/fallbacks","children":[{"type":"inlineComponent","name":"inline-code","tagName":"md-inline-code","attributes":{},"children":[],"properties":{"html":"<span class=\"th-token th-function\">firstThatWorks</span>()","source":"firstThatWorks()"}}]},{"type":"text","value":",\n"},{"type":"link","href":"/docs/styling/anchor-positioning","children":[{"type":"inlineComponent","name":"inline-code","tagName":"md-inline-code","attributes":{},"children":[],"properties":{"html":"<span class=\"th-token th-function\">positionTry</span>()","source":"positionTry()"}}]},{"type":"text","value":" and\n"},{"type":"link","href":"/docs/styling/view-transitions","children":[{"type":"inlineComponent","name":"inline-code","tagName":"md-inline-code","attributes":{},"children":[],"properties":{"html":"<span class=\"th-token th-function\">viewTransition</span>()","source":"viewTransition()"}}]},{"type":"text","value":"."}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"link","href":"/docs/project/agent-skills","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Agent skills"}]}]},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineComponent","name":"inline-code","tagName":"md-inline-code","attributes":{},"children":[],"properties":{"html":"<span class=\"th-token th-command\">kirana</span>","source":"kirana"}},{"type":"text","value":" and "},{"type":"inlineComponent","name":"inline-code","tagName":"md-inline-code","attributes":{},"children":[],"properties":{"html":"kirana-migrate","source":"kirana-migrate"}},{"type":"text","value":"."}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Still to do: publishing the Zed extension to Zed's registry."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"m4-ecosystem","children":[{"type":"text","value":"M4: Ecosystem"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Done, and published."}]},{"type":"text","value":" Kirana installed outside this repository, and proven so\non every change."}]},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Every package on npm"}]},{"type":"text","value":", released together from CI with provenance, and the\nnative engine for eight platforms plus a WASI build that writes the same bytes."}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Installation tested on every change:"}]},{"type":"text","value":" CI installs the packed tarballs with\nnpm, pnpm, Yarn and Bun on Linux, macOS, Windows and Alpine, builds an example\nand checks it in a browser. Installing from the registry with Yarn and Deno,\nwhich CI cannot test against tarballs, was checked by hand with 0.2.0."}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Bundlers:"}]},{"type":"text","value":" Vite, Rolldown, webpack, Rspack and Rsbuild, Parcel, Bun,\nesbuild, PostCSS and Jest, each with an example, and a check that every one\ncompiles the same source to the same classes as Vite."}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Frameworks:"}]},{"type":"text","value":" a guide and a tested example for each, from React, Vue, Svelte,\nSolid, Qwik, Angular and Ember to Next.js, Nuxt, SvelteKit, Astro and\nAnalog."}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Server templates:"}]},{"type":"text","value":" Laravel, Symfony, Rails, Phoenix and AdonisJS, through a\nclass map and a helper per template language, published to Packagist,\nRubyGems, Hex and npm."}]}]}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"m5-utility-surface","children":[{"type":"text","value":"M5: Utility surface"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Done."}]},{"type":"text","value":" "},{"type":"link","href":"/docs/styling/utilities","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Utility strings"}]},{"type":"text","value":" in "},{"type":"inlineComponent","name":"inline-code","tagName":"md-inline-code","attributes":{},"children":[],"properties":{"html":"sx","source":"sx"}},{"type":"text","value":", from a grammar a\npreset declares as data."}]},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineComponent","name":"inline-code","tagName":"md-inline-code","attributes":{},"children":[],"properties":{"html":"@kirana-style/preset-scales","source":"@kirana-style/preset-scales"}},{"type":"text","value":" ships Tailwind v4's names, including composed\nutilities (rings, shadows, translations, filters) and pseudo-elements. A\nproperty test compiles all 7,391 utilities the grammar generates and checks\neach gives the same atoms as its object."}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineComponent","name":"inline-code","tagName":"md-inline-code","attributes":{},"children":[],"properties":{"html":"<span class=\"th-token th-command\">kirana-style</span> migrate tailwind","source":"kirana-style migrate tailwind"}},{"type":"text","value":" is built on the same lowering. Run over the\nTailwind original of our shadcn/ui port, then 38 hand fixes, conformance finds\n"},{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"zero computed-style differences"}]},{"type":"text","value":" on all 189 routes of the three\napplications, at three widths, in both colour schemes, at rest and with\noverlays and menus open. The "},{"type":"link","href":"/docs/migration/from-tailwind","children":[{"type":"text","value":"migration guide"}]},{"type":"text","value":"\nhas the numbers and every pitfall the hand fixes resolved."}]}]}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"m6-1-0","children":[{"type":"text","value":"M6: 1.0"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Next."}]},{"type":"text","value":" What 1.0 promises, and what it takes to promise it:"}]},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"an API freeze, after which a breaking change waits for 2.0;"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"the full conformance suite;"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"a public benchmark report under the claims policy;"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"trademark clearance for the name;"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"a security review of the evaluator."}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Before it, one change outside these milestones: restricted overrides, where a\ncomponent declares which properties its "},{"type":"inlineComponent","name":"inline-code","tagName":"md-inline-code","attributes":{},"children":[],"properties":{"html":"sx","source":"sx"}},{"type":"text","value":" accepts ("},{"type":"inlineComponent","name":"inline-code","tagName":"md-inline-code","attributes":{},"children":[],"properties":{"html":"<span class=\"th-token th-type\">Sx</span>&lt;<span class=\"th-token th-string\">&quot;color&quot;</span> | <span class=\"th-token th-string\">&quot;margin&quot;</span>&gt;","source":"Sx<\"color\" | \"margin\">"}},{"type":"text","value":"),\nchecked by TypeScript at the call site."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"the-gates","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The gates"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Two points where the project checked itself rather than continuing by momentum:"}]},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Gate 1"}]},{"type":"text","value":", after M1: does the output hold up against the originals, and is\nthe authoring API worth the trouble?"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Gate 2"}]},{"type":"text","value":", after M2: do recipes and dynamic styles carry a real application?"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Both are passed. The "},{"type":"link","href":"/docs/project/status","children":[{"type":"text","value":"status page"}]},{"type":"text","value":" lists what that means\nconcretely."}]}],"headings":[{"id":"roadmap","text":"Roadmap","level":1},{"id":"m0-foundations","text":"M0: Foundations","level":2},{"id":"m1-feasibility-slice","text":"M1: Feasibility slice","level":2},{"id":"m2-recipes-and-dynamic-styles","text":"M2: Recipes and dynamic styles","level":2},{"id":"m3-developer-experience","text":"M3: Developer experience","level":2},{"id":"m4-ecosystem","text":"M4: Ecosystem","level":2},{"id":"m5-utility-surface","text":"M5: Utility surface","level":2},{"id":"m6-1-0","text":"M6: 1.0","level":2},{"id":"the-gates","text":"The gates","level":2}]}
